WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:02.934
-President Biden last week
nominated

00:00:02.934 --> 00:00:04.601
Judge Ketanji Brown Jackson

00:00:04.601 --> 00:00:06.801
to be the first black woman on
the Supreme Court.

00:00:06.801 --> 00:00:09.968
She's a DC -- Absolutely.

00:00:09.968 --> 00:00:11.334
[ Applause ]
-Absolutely.

00:00:11.334 --> 00:00:15.000
She is a DC District Court
judge, a Harvard graduate --

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.300
oh, and this is fun --

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:18.467
she also did improve in college.

00:00:18.467 --> 00:00:21.501
But more than all those things,
more than all those things,

00:00:21.501 --> 00:00:22.734
she's a role model.

00:00:22.734 --> 00:00:24.200
Here to talk about that
is one of our writers,

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:25.467
Amber Ruffin, everybody!

00:00:25.467 --> 00:00:27.501
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:27.501 --> 00:00:29.067
-Hey.

00:00:29.067 --> 00:00:32.133
When I look at
Ketanji Brown-Jackson,

00:00:32.133 --> 00:00:33.267
I feel inspired.

00:00:33.267 --> 00:00:34.400
[ Gentle music playing ]

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:38.267
I feel motivated,
like I can do anything.

00:00:38.267 --> 00:00:42.834
I see her and I think...

00:00:42.834 --> 00:00:48.667
♪ Maybe I could be
something so special ♪

00:00:48.667 --> 00:00:51.100
♪ If my eyes could
see the future ♪

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:53.767
♪ They'd know that it
looks bright ♪

00:00:53.767 --> 00:00:59.167
♪ Maybe I'd be unafraid,
I'd have the ear of a nation ♪

00:00:59.167 --> 00:01:04.200
♪ Maybe I could help to
make our wrongs right ♪

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:06.567
Ladies and gentlemen,
Jenny Hagel.

00:01:06.567 --> 00:01:09.400
[ Applause ]

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:12.300
♪♪

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:16.834
-♪ Maybe I could be
something so special ♪

00:01:16.834 --> 00:01:22.300
♪ I would try to see
the good in my fellow man ♪

00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:28.167
♪ Maybe folks would look to me
to be the inspiration ♪

00:01:28.167 --> 00:01:32.634
♪ Women of color would look
at me and know they can ♪

00:01:32.634 --> 00:01:33.801
Ladies and gentlemen --

00:01:33.801 --> 00:01:36.033
Oh, no. Scollins?

00:01:36.033 --> 00:01:37.634
-♪ Maybe I could be -- ♪

00:01:37.634 --> 00:01:40.200
-What are you doing?

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:42.801
-I'm inspired,
so I'm singing along.

00:01:42.801 --> 00:01:45.133
-No, no. She's inspiring
because she's a woman.

00:01:45.133 --> 00:01:46.400
-And 'cause she's black.

00:01:46.400 --> 00:01:49.901
-She also did improv, like me.

00:01:49.901 --> 00:01:51.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.033 --> 00:01:53.033
That inspires me.

00:01:53.033 --> 00:01:55.100
-No! Scollins, get out!

00:01:55.100 --> 00:01:57.334
-But she -- she was
an improviser!

00:01:57.334 --> 00:01:58.634
Seth, tell them.

00:01:58.634 --> 00:02:00.734
[ Gentle music continues ]

00:02:00.734 --> 00:02:02.300
-I'll allow it.

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:04.667
[ Laughter ]

00:02:04.667 --> 00:02:08.400
-♪ Maybe my improv classes
were worth it ♪

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:09.934
-You've got to be kidding me.

00:02:09.934 --> 00:02:13.734
-♪ Tell my mom she's not alone
in blowing her two grand ♪

00:02:13.734 --> 00:02:14.968
-Oh, gross!

00:02:14.968 --> 00:02:16.834
-♪ Maybe improvisers,
as a people ♪

00:02:16.834 --> 00:02:19.968
♪ Will finally come together ♪

00:02:19.968 --> 00:02:24.667
♪ To take suggestions
and reply "yes, and!" ♪

00:02:24.667 --> 00:02:26.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:28.434
Ladies and gentlemen, Ally Hord.

00:02:28.434 --> 00:02:30.334
-No, Scollins, you ruined it.

00:02:30.334 --> 00:02:31.834
[ Laughter ]

00:02:31.834 --> 00:02:35.868
-Yes, and by ruining it,
I made it better.

00:02:35.868 --> 00:02:37.467
Zip!
-No!

00:02:37.467 --> 00:02:38.701
-Zop!
-No!!

00:02:38.701 --> 00:02:39.567
-No!
-No!

00:02:39.567 --> 00:02:41.000
-Boing!
-No, no, no!

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:44.267
-Amber, Jenny -- ugh --
Scollins, Ally, everyone.

00:02:44.267 --> 00:02:46.534
We'll be right back
with Amanda Seyfried.

00:02:46.534 --> 00:02:51.067
♪♪

00:02:51.067 --> 00:02:55.634
♪♪

